{"version":1,"content":"<p>通用汽車日前在紐約舉行的「Onward」技術活動上公佈了一系列圍繞人工智能、電動汽車和自動駕駛的未來規劃。面對中國汽車企業日益激烈的競爭壓力，這家傳統汽車製造商正試圖將自身定位為一家由軟件和人工智能驅動的科技企業，而不僅僅是一家汽車公司。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583266.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.508697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:05:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"06b59a4712a91f238c84e77bf010fc65522bcb3a15c5d050bd821275a96b7eb2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}